# Placeholder so this folder ships with the template and is here before you
# need it.
#
# Migrating an existing app onto this framework? Put the whole thing in this
# folder and tell the assistant. Everything you drop here is ignored by git, so
# nothing leaks into the repository before it has been looked at - not even a
# .env file.
#
# The assistant reads it as a reference and rebuilds the app on this template's
# structure; it never edits or deletes anything in here. Once the rewrite is
# working, you can delete this whole folder.
